{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こにゃにゃちわー（＾＿＾）☆ぴ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/24/3631056/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに私服どーん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"派手めなワンピ♪(´ε｀ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日の乃木どこで、カップリング曲「涙がまだ悲しみだった頃」のＭＶが公開されたね(^ ^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな見たー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかくみんな可愛すぎるから、たくさんの方に観て欲しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや本当、みんな本当に可愛いんです。あ、知ってるか。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"押し変しちゃやーよm(._.)mぷぅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"押し変しちゃやーよm(._.)mぷぅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事な事なので2回言いました。え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーとねマメ知識。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、愛されてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほらね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/24/3631056/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみの顔。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は嬉しいくせにね。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたし性格ウサギだからね、こうやってみんなに構ってもらえないとこうなっちゃうわけよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/24/3631056/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに新幹線の中のわたし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新幹線でこういった人見つけても暖かい目でお守りくだしゃい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返す。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. 能條は重量挙げっていうスポーツ知ってる!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺、120キロ持ち上げられます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.知ってるよおっ！120キロ！？それはすごい！この能條も軽く持ち上げられる訳だっ！！素晴らしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. 俺のことまだ覚えとる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚えとったら俺の特徴あげてみて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.優しいお顔と優しいオーラの持ち主っ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. メンバーと喧嘩したことはありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.メンバーとないなあ！！喧嘩は嫌いやあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. あみあみは物覚えいい方ですか？私のこと覚えてますかね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.覚えてるよおっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの感動の瞬間一緒にいたじゃない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後のティッシュありがとうね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. 今年から柔道部の主将になるねんけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不安で仕方ないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うまくまとめるにはどうしたらいいでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.誰だって大きな責任を任された時は、不安で怖くてしょうがないよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"失敗してもいいの！「失敗、反省、成功」を繰り返していこ？あなたが本気でぶつかっていけば、必ずみんなに伝わるから。大丈夫、見てる人は見てくれてるよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. 久しぶりのコメですが...大丈夫だよねっ？３ヶ月ぐらいしてなかったような"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うー久しぶり！毎日コメントしてよお？？↷꒰ू´•௰ू• `꒱↷ 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. ７月14日大阪でまりかとペアーで４回握手していただいたものですけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服の色は分かりませんがリュックはしてました 覚えていますか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.覚えてるよぉっ！よかったらまたあみのとこにも来てね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ .あみあみは「芸人」って呼ばれてるみたいだけど、いつから呼ばれてるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ボーリングのあの悲劇が乃木ここにて公開になってからかしら。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. 電車でどっか行ったのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.仙台に行く時に東京駅で撮ったんだよん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. 私服はどこで買ってるの？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.原宿が最近は多いかな？？行き当たりばったりだね♪(´ε｀ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.そう言えばあみちゃん最近料理してる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.あー最近はしてないいー！そろそろしよっかな(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.作ってみたい料理はあるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.そうだなぁー、洋食作れるようになったらかっこいいよね！？ってことでパスタとか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ .大阪の握手会でまりかにすいとうばい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言った俺やけど覚えてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.あれはね、反則ですよ反則。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．暑い日に食べるならどっちがいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１．冷やし中華"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２．そうめん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.2のそうめんだなあ！！って言ったら食べたくなってきた ( ◞˟૩˟)◞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. あみあみがどうしても食べられない食べ物は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.レバー。あれは一生無理。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. 握手会で来るファン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初に見るのは、まず顔じゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ２番めに目が行くのは何処でしょう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来れば３番めも教えて欲しいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.２番目は目線！！ちゃんとあみを見てくれてるかな？って。あとは人柄とかだね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. あみちゃんってなんでそんなにおもしろいん?? 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.えーなんにも面白くないよおー ( ◞˟૩˟)◞  ありのままに生きてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. 他のメンバーに服装の事で突っ込まれたりする？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.んー特にないかな？でも昨日と今日で服装の系統が全然違うねとかは言われる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. 「できる！」ってコトなんで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メが見たい( ´▽ ` )ﾉ最終確認！ウインク、できるんだよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.出来ます！！だがしかしもうしばしお待ちをっ！次回載っけるね（＾∇＾）！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. 七瀬と仲良しだと思うけど、最近2人で遊びに行ったのはどこですかー??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.七瀬とは2人でまだ遊んだ事ないな～！お泊まりならよくさせていただいております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. 最近あみあみの私服がすごくワイルドだけど、あみあみはスギちゃんすき？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.わぁいるどだるぉ？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってスギちゃん意識してなーいっ！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも好きですよ（＾∇＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ .さぁ300ﾍﾟｰｼﾞの本をA君は5日B君は10かけて読みましたさぁ2人協力したら何日で読めるでしょ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.むっずかしいなぁー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだろ、15日？？わかんないよおー正解ぷりーず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. メンバーの物真似、何人ぐらい出来るの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.4人くらいかな？"},{"typ